%% Message Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent1 as Agent A
    participant MessageService
    participant Message
    participant Agent2 as Agent B

    Agent1->>MessageService: Send message to Agent B
    MessageService->>Message: CREATE Message<br/>(from=agent1.id, to=agent2.id, content)
    Message->>Message: Set sent_at
    Note over Message: received_at = null

    Agent2->>MessageService: Check inbox
    MessageService->>Message: Get messages WHERE to=agent2.id AND received_at=null
    Message->>Message: Set received_at
    MessageService-->>Agent2: Return messages
